{"id":"kredit","lemma":"Kredit","pos":"noun","rank":3113,"glosses":["loan or anything afforded to someone in the expectation of return","credibility, informal credit rating, the ability of someone to get loans based on his reputation"],"ipa":"/kʁeˈdiːt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0b/De-Kredit.ogg/De-Kredit.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Kredites","plural":"Kredite"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich brauche einen Kredit.","en":"I need a loan.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/221715","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Es ist kein Kredit.","en":"It isn't a loan.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"no / not a"},null]},{"text":"Ich denke, du wirst einen Kredit brauchen.","en":"I think you'll need a loan.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to need"}]},{"text":"Er bekam einen Kredit von der Bank.","en":"He got a loan from the bank.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to receive","l":"bekommen"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"bench"}]},{"text":"Er will seinen Kredit zurückbezahlen.","en":"He wants to pay off his loan.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null,null]}]}